            it makes sense to say that a vacuum state is stable if there is vanishing
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+probability"} quantum probability
            for the vacuum state to scatter into a non-vacuum state, or for a non-vacuum state to scatter into the vacuum state. (e.g.
            = succeed ")" do
